er Hauer","role":"Curtiz","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xyag0LbjocTwx2Ht7B3RofvCNMT.jpg"},{"id":1859,"name":"Christiane Paul","role":"Boutique Saleslady","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/h1Cr9GA5C29FhDzbRZ6qrLTydjB.jpg"},{"id":1860,"name":"Hannes Jaenicke","role":"Police Officer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v8tuXD74U4ZBf2q0PmCK5VZ5m1n.jpg"},{"id":1861,"name":"Markus Knüfken","role":"Police Officer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1OI4tuTCIRbyDeVPK9MJrCSUiZi.jpg"},{"id":1862,"name":"Willi Thomczyk","role":"Car Dealer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rjBWaaxXXL0MBI1OOjDYvl1msyF.jpg"},{"id":1863,"name":"Tobias Schenke","role":"Boy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mhw4nITzm3QpZN3ihvmtM4v6JXz.jpg"},{"id":1864,"name":"Jenny Elvers","role":"Ward A Nurse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ffSoNMAxabDVWQCjgecXKagJ3ny.jpg"},{"id":680,"name":"Corinna Harfouch","role":"Ward B Nurse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vPs5o94S0as2VSnj4JSATnNTmZa.jpg"},{"id":1865,"name":"Hark Bohm","role":"Police Psychologist","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbK0MB6h73iuqXJ4e8ttaKdHB1C.jpg"},{"id":1866,"name":"Muriel Baumeister","role":"Emergency Room Nurse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9AHCVa0Og6hCQAQAwIw0PspZJRI.jpg"},{"id":3842,"name":"Jürgen Becker","role":"Gas Station Attendant","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9AN2BcGRXdeFNw1FFqKlKtqY6nD.jpg"},{"id":3843,"name":"Wolfgang Kaven","role":"Dr. Graf"},{"id":3844,"name":"Bernd Hoffmann","role":"Dr. Wortmann"},{"id":3845,"name":"Helen Duval","role":"Madam","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jI74r4GrBWMssutxUXcp3GKBpLT.jpg"},{"id":1848,"name":"Christoph Ott","role":"Police Officer at Elevator"},{"id":1869,"name":"Sönke Wortmann","role":"Director","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hFQeziBgFDu5YsLb5ofqTErq0J9.jpg"},{"id":27406,"name":"Florian Fitz","role":"Police Officer","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fufexncLLZXHocUgGs0sgvaRB8o.jpg"},{"id":68326,"name":"Xenia Seeberg","role":"Police Officer at Hotel","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cj3WNbzp4T1p2TwMZQqisE8s5RG.jpg"},{"id":66596,"name":"Vladimir Weigl","role":"Harald Rohwitz","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gF1JBQWArI5LTmjYXjRy4Usba03.jpg"},{"id":48512,"name":"Tyron Ricketts","role":"Plainclothes Policeman #2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rPw0hjmjASLhel1el4aAqWoZxOU.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Martin e Rudi si conoscono in ospedale e scoprono di essere entrambi malati terminali. Decidono di compiere un ultimo viaggio verso il mare, ma l'automobile che rubano appartiene a criminali che si mettono subito sulle loro tracce."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Two young men, Martin and Rudi, both suffering from terminal cancer, get to know each other in a hospital room. They drown their desperation in tequila and decide to take one last trip to the sea. Drunk and still in pajamas they steal the first fancy car they find, a 60's Mercedes convertible. The car happens to belong to a bunch of gangsters, which immediately start to chase it, since it contains more than the pistol Martin finds in the glove box."},{"language":"de-DE","overview":"Martin und Rudi treffen in einer Klinik zusammen. Beider Diagnose: baldiger Tod durch Gehirntumor bzw. Knochenkrebs. Die gegensätzlichen Typen entschließen sich ans Meer zu fahren, weil Rudi da noch nie gewesen ist. Und weil im Himmel immer nur vom Meer geredet wird, stehlen sie ein schnelles Auto und machen sich auf den Weg. Leider handelt es sich dabei um den Wagen von Henk und Abdul, zwei nicht allzu gelungenen Gangstern, und im Kofferraum liegt eine Million, die dem Boß der beiden gehört. Martin und Rudi kennen kein Pardon und lassen sich auch von der Polizei nicht aufhalten, der sie erfolgreich vorspielen, Entführer und Geisel zu sein. So kommt es zu einer turbulenten und bleihaltigen Reise in Richtung Meer, verfolgt von Obrigkeit und Gangstern, sowie von den eigenen Gebrechen, die ihnen die Zeit stehlen.","tagline":"Ein schnelles Auto, 1 Million Mark im Kofferraum und nur noch eine Woche zu leben."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9pTUCXcMDZurDmZRtOrnk9mjSFH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yXnlw2SB0QhYUC4QDyuRZh3CQlU.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":158,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"de-DE","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiaGyQtjI5rnFDI7BVngXyfmVhc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oiaGyQtjI5rnFDI7BVngXyfmVhc.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiaGyQtjI5rnFDI7BVngXyfmVhc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oiaGyQtjI5rnFDI7BVngXyfmVhc.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"de":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9pTUCXcMDZurDmZRtOrnk9mjSFH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9pTUCXcMDZurDmZRtOrnk9mjSFH.jpg","language":"de","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9pTUCXcMDZurDmZRtOrnk9mjSFH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9pTUCXcMDZurDmZRtOrnk9mjSFH.jpg","language":"de","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dsY09zCxKDFjfV1oqXFJJpVrHdP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dsY09zCxKDFjfV1oqXFJJpVrHdP.jpg","language":"de","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Qnh5khKtaRq01dniIOCHniRf